Upgrades all `@objectstack/*` dependencies from `^2.0.4` to `^2.0.7` and aligns documentation with the expanded spec surface (70+ new UI types).

### Dependency upgrade
- All 10 `@objectstack/*` packages bumped across 13 `package.json` files (root, apps, packages, examples)

### I18nLabel type fix
Spec v2.0.7 widens `I18nLabel` from `string` to `string | { key; defaultValue?; params? }`, breaking 22+ call sites.

Added `resolveI18nLabel()` utility and applied it to all affected components:

```ts
// packages/react/src/utils/i18n.ts
export function resolveI18nLabel(
  label: string | { key: string; defaultValue?: string; params?: Record<string, any> } | undefined
): string | undefined {
  if (label == null) return undefined;
  if (typeof label === 'string') return label;
  return label.defaultValue || label.key;
}
```

**Fixed files:** `FieldFactory.tsx`, `FormRenderer.tsx`, `AppSidebar.tsx`, `DashboardView.tsx`

### Documentation rewrite
- **SPEC_COMPLIANCE_EVALUATION.md** — Updated to v2.0.7; compliance adjusted 91% → 82% (expanded spec surface); 21 new improvement items for DnD, gestures, notifications, offline/sync, accessibility, etc.
- **OBJECTSTACK_CLIENT_EVALUATION.md** — Coverage upgraded 92% (22/24) → 100% (24/24); realtime/offline gaps resolved in client v2.0.7
- **ROADMAP.md** — Full rewrite: quarterly plan organized by v2.0.7 protocol domains

### Verification
41/41 builds pass, 2961/2961 tests pass, no advisory vulnerabilities.

